--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

PEEL-Local loads, but does not redistribute, the following models. Each
carries its own licence:

  - GlossBERT (jvomiranda/GlossBERT_Checkpoint, Hugging Face Hub) --
    after Huang et al. (2019), "GlossBERT: BERT for Word Sense
    Disambiguation with Gloss Knowledge".
  - sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (Hugging Face Hub).
  - spaCy language models (en_core_web_sm by default).
  - WordNet (Princeton University) via NLTK.
  - Whichever model the researcher selects under Ollama for Phase 2
    condensation and adversarial review.
